<title>USA: St Paul hogs $2.00 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Paul hogs $2.00 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST PAUL 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $2.00 higher compared to Monday. Top $57.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3     220-250 lbs   57.00</p>
<p>	     250-260 lbs   56.50-57.00</p>
<p>	     260-270 lbs   55.50-56.50</p>
<p>US 2-3     270-280 lbs   54.50-55.50</p>
<p>US 2-4     280-290 lbs   53.50-54.50</p>
<p>Sows: steady to 0.50 lower. Top 49.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3     300-500 lbs   45.50-46.50</p>
<p>	     500-550 lbs   47.00-48.00</p>
<p>	     550-700 lbs   48.00-49.00</p>
</text>
